//! The `aspect-ratio` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property allows you to
//! define the desired width-to-height ratio of an element's box.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
