module std.css.properties.AspectRatio.

/// `Replaced elements` with an intrinsic aspect ratio use _that_ aspect ratio, otherwise the box has
/// no preferred aspect ratio. Size calculations involving intrinsic aspect ratio always work with
/// the content box dimensions.

